    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Create a flowchart to implement **one** of the following rules:\r\n\r\n   a. A customer can enter the movie only if they meet the age requirement **AND** have a ticket.\r\n\r\n   b. A customer can enter the movie if they meet the age requirement **OR** have a ticket. \r\n\r\n2. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n",
